---
title: "oauth_userinfo (stem-system: Clubhouse Manager)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_extract_header: read Authorization header
    q_extract_header --> q_error_no_auth: header missing or not Bearer
    q_extract_header --> q_extract_token: header starts with "Bearer "
    q_error_no_auth --> [*]: return 401 missing/invalid authorization
    q_extract_token --> q_verify: token = header.substring(7)
    q_verify --> q_error_invalid: verifyAccessToken(token) returns null
    q_verify --> q_respond: token verified, payload extracted
    q_error_invalid --> [*]: return 401 invalid/expired token
    q_respond --> [*]: return JSON (sub, display_name, discord_id, generation, status)

    note right of q_verify
        INV-001: token must be valid JWT signed with HS256 and correct JWT_SECRET
        INV-002: token issuer and audience claims must match expected values
        INV-003: token must not be expired
    end note
